"g|zh|HSK 1|否定副词: 别 (Jangan)":[["你别说话。","Nǐ bié shuō huà.","Jangan berbicara.","别","Jangan"],["你别去了。","Nǐ bié qù le.","Jangan pergi.","别","Jangan"],["别买这个杯子。","Bié mǎi zhè ge bēizi.","Jangan membeli gelas ini.","别","Jangan"],["请别在这儿喝茶。","Qǐng bié zài zhèr hē chá.","Tolong jangan minum teh di sini.","别","jangan"],["你别太高兴了。","Nǐ bié tài gāoxìng le.","Jangan terlalu senang.","别","Jangan"],["你别喝太多水。","Nǐ bié hē tài duō shuǐ.","Jangan minum terlalu banyak air.","别","Jangan"],["别坐在桌子上。","Bié zuò zài zhuōzi shàng.","Jangan duduk di atas meja.","别","Jangan"],["你别在家看电视了。","Nǐ bié zài jiā kàn diànshì le.","Jangan menonton TV di rumah lagi.","别","Jangan"],["今天下雨，你别去商店了。","Jīntiān xiàyǔ, nǐ bié qù shāngdiàn le.","Hari ini hujan, jangan pergi ke toko.","别","jangan"],["妈妈说别看电视了。","Māma shuō bié kàn diànshì le.","Ibu bilang jangan menonton TV lagi.","别","jangan"],["你别打电话了，他在睡觉。","Nǐ bié dǎ diànhuà le, tā zài shuìjiào.","Jangan menelepon lagi, dia sedang tidur.","别","Jangan"],["老师说，我们别在学校里喝茶。","Lǎoshī shuō, wǒmen bié zài xuéxiào li hē chá.","Guru bilang kita jangan minum teh di sekolah.","别","jangan"]],
